  "system": {
    "finalName": "",
    "description": "<p>You may enter a brief meditative state as a <a href=\"/wiki/Full-Round_Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Full-Round Action\">Full-Round Action</a>. You may remain in this trance as long as you wish, and you are still aware of your surroundings; however, you are otherwise <a href=\"/wiki/Helpless\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Helpless\">Helpless</a> and cannot perform any other <a href=\"/wiki/Actions\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Actions\">Actions</a>. Upon emerging from the trance (As a <a href=\"/wiki/Swift_Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Swift Action\">Swift Action</a>), your first attack roll or <a href=\"/wiki/Use_the_Force\" title=\"Use the Force\">Use the Force</a> skill check made in the following round is considered to be a <a href=\"/wiki/Natural_20\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Natural 20\">Natural 20</a>.</p>",
